@guide H_55_EasternPlaguelands
@name Eastern Plaguelands (56-57)
@faction Horde
@levels 56-57
@zone Eastern Plaguelands
@chapter Azeroth
@desc Eastern Plaguelands, visit 1 of 1 on the Horde route, levels 56-57.
@next H_56_WesternPlaguelands

travel Eastern Plaguelands
train
accept 5142 Little Pamela [zone=Western Plaguelands] | Marlene Redpath in the house at Sorrow Hill, south Western Plaguelands, on your way east.
note Ride east out of the Western Plaguelands along the Thondroril River. Tirion Fordring's hut is just inside the border, by the river.
accept 5542 Demon Dogs | Tirion Fordring.
accept 5543 Blood Tinged Skies | Tirion Fordring.
accept 5544 Carrion Grubbage | Tirion Fordring.
accept 6164 Augustus' Receipt Book | Augustus the Touched at the hut in Terrordale, north-west. He is friendly; ignore the ghouls around him.
complete 6164 Augustus' Receipt Book | The book is upstairs in the inn across the road.
turnin 6164 Augustus' Receipt Book
note Ride the road east across the zone to Light's Hope Chapel.
fp Light's Hope Chapel
turnin 6030 Duke Nicholas Zverenhoff [optional] | Duke Nicholas Zverenhoff, Light's Hope Chapel (from Winterspring).
accept 5251 The Archivist [dungeon=Stratholme]
accept 6021 Zaeldarr the Outcast | Caretaker Alen, Light's Hope Chapel.
accept 5281 The Restless Souls
complete 5542 Demon Dogs | Plaguehounds and Frenzied Plaguehounds around Light's Hope and the north; Plaguehound Runts in the south.
complete 5544 Carrion Grubbage | Slabs of Carrion Worm Meat from Carrion Grubs, often next to the plaguehounds.
complete 5543 Blood Tinged Skies | Plaguebats are everywhere south of the road.
turnin 5142 Little Pamela | Pamela Redpath in Darrowshire, south.
accept 5149 Pamela's Doll
complete 5149 Pamela's Doll | The doll's head, dress and stuffing are in the ruined houses of Darrowshire. Ghosts appear when you loot them.
turnin 5149 Pamela's Doll
accept 5241 Uncle Carlin
complete 6021 Zaeldarr the Outcast | Zaeldarr in the Darrowshire crypt, west side of the village.
accept 6022 To Kill With Purpose | Nathanos Blightcaller at Marris Stead, west of Darrowshire.
accept 6024 Hameya's Plea
accept 6133 The Ranger Lord's Behest
accept 6042 Un-Life's Little Annoyances | Nathanos Blightcaller.
complete 6022 To Kill With Purpose | Coagulated Rot from the ghouls and flayers around Darrowshire and the Marris Stead.
complete 6042 Un-Life's Little Annoyances | Noxious Plaguebats south, Monstrous Plaguebats north.
turnin 6022 To Kill With Purpose
turnin 6042 Un-Life's Little Annoyances
turnin 5542 Demon Dogs | Tirion Fordring.
turnin 5281 The Restless Souls
turnin 5543 Blood Tinged Skies
turnin 5544 Carrion Grubbage
note Ride back east to Light's Hope Chapel.
turnin 6021 Zaeldarr the Outcast | Caretaker Alen.
turnin 5241 Uncle Carlin | Carlin Redpath.
accept 5212 The Flesh Does Not Lie [dungeon=Stratholme]
accept 5243 Houses of the Holy [dungeon=Stratholme]
accept 5529 Plagued Hatchlings [dungeon=Scholomance]
complete 5251 The Archivist [dungeon=Stratholme]
turnin 5251 The Archivist [dungeon=Stratholme]
complete 6024 Hameya's Plea
complete 6133 The Ranger Lord's Behest
turnin 6133 The Ranger Lord's Behest
accept 5742 Redemption
complete 5742 Redemption
turnin 6024 Hameya's Plea
complete 5212 The Flesh Does Not Lie [dungeon=Stratholme]
complete 5243 Houses of the Holy [dungeon=Stratholme]
complete 5529 Plagued Hatchlings [dungeon=Scholomance]
turnin 5212 The Flesh Does Not Lie [dungeon=Stratholme]
turnin 5243 Houses of the Holy [dungeon=Stratholme]
turnin 5529 Plagued Hatchlings [dungeon=Scholomance]
turnin 5742 Redemption
level 57 | Western Plaguelands starts at 57. If you are lower, kill what is around you here (or run a dungeon) until you reach it.
